Assuming your "something" is indefinite (i.e. you'd be satisfied by
whatever green thing), this is somewhat true, though I think xorlo makes it
more slippery than your example. That is, {lo crino} could just be a blob
of all the green things and could interact with sisku in such a way that
you're satisfied by finding any of them.

